abstract: >-
  AI-readable paper skill for Fischer et al. (2025), Journal of Power Sources 656, 237921,
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.237921. It contains the full article text with searchable
  equation transcriptions, Figures 1 to 8 and Tables 1 to 5 and C.6 (CSV), for use with Claude,
  Claude Code or Codex. Converted with Paper2Agent (Miao et al., Nature 2026,
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-11044-y). The package contains no raw data and no code.
